                <p>
                    3.1 The Processor processes personal data only on documented instructions from the Controller.
                </p>
                <p>
                    3.2 The Processor implements appropriate technical and organizational measures (TOMs)
                    pursuant to Art. 32 GDPR. The TOMs are described in Annex 1.
                </p>
                <p>
                    3.3 The Processor supports the Controller in fulfilling data subject rights.
                </p>
                <p>
                    3.4 The Processor reports data breaches to the Controller without undue delay.
                </p>
                <p>
                    3.5 The Processor deletes or returns personal data after termination of the contract,
                    unless statutory retention obligations exist.
                </p>
            </section>

